    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκατα-βαίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>descend by degrees,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Clearch.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				1.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).145
			</span></i>; <i>come down,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.4.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				40.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>go back gradually,</i> i. e. <i>relax</i> severity of
			régime, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>settle down,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				938b31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				2.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκαταβάς,</span>
			<i>lower down in the text,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1351.43
			</span></i>, al.</div>
